:{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sniper from the SORD unit based at St. Aile’s International, sister school to Mihama Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It’s said that once she has you in her sights, there’s no escape - hence her nickname, “Mystic Eye”. Her main weapon is a Blaser R93."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gumi behaves like an old-school war veteran, and tends to adopt a ludicrously single-minded approach to her duties. Burning with a powerful sense of justice, Gumi takes a hard line against unscrupulous behavior; the harshness of her rebukes can come as quite a shock."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her special skill is speed eating, and she won’t be beaten in this by anyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Sorry, senpai. There's still something I need to do - one task I have to complete.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62418"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a27cc28a6d01148bbc9f150ca76412fbf697a54f71c55a544e245477a0d1504.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/9061433466960d92af3dcbd46029aa318443ffc8faa5d306316f82496f10d435.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"三森 すずこ","creatorId":"vndb:s627","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s627","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s627","name":"三森 すずこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:77395","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c62419","characterName":"シルビア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c62419"},"originalCharacterName":"シルビア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descripti